ization skills in learning Statics throught the use of spatial visualization tools. Copyright © Jose L. De La Hoz, Camilo Vieira, Alfredo J. Ojeda, Gabriel Garcia-Yepes, 2021.	https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/3f17490c13c34a4049aa6c83ae92864ab267e3bf	2026-07-27 13:14:02.649073	semantic_scholar	3f17490c13c34a4049aa6c83ae92864ab267e3bf
