methodology, scoring functions, evaluation protocol, implementation considerations, and enterprise governance controls for deploying such a framework in regulated software engineering environments. The central contribution is a research-oriented, implementation-ready approach that treats program comprehension as a context-aware, evidence-grounded, and continuously updated intelligence layer for software maintenance, modernization, and release risk assessment.	https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/db51ecfed85c3588cf3b273f3516b138f7c9edac	2026-07-27 13:14:03.37617	semantic_scholar	db51ecfed85c3588cf3b273f3516b138f7c9edac
